    "short_description": "SPIE Global Services Energy is a leading provider of multi-technical services in the energy sector, operating as a subsidiary of SPIE Group. Established in 2004, the company specializes in comprehensive services throughout the energy production infrastructure value chain, including design, engineering, commissioning, operation, and maintenance. It serves the oil, gas, and renewable energy industries, emphasizing safety in all operations.\n\nWith a global presence in approximately 23 to 30 countries, SPIE Global Services Energy employs around 5,000 to 5,500 people from over 75 nationalities. The company offers tailored solutions in five core areas: operation and maintenance, commissioning and start-up, project engineering and construction, assessment and competency development, and well delivery and management. Its strategic vision focuses on supporting the energy transition by enhancing energy efficiency and reducing carbon footprints while ensuring high safety standards.",
